{"sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","items":[{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k001","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"이상기체 PV=nRT에서 T는 절대온도다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k002","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"일정 T에서 P∝1/V, 일정 P에서 V∝T이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k003","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"혼합 이상기체에서 Dalton 법칙 P=ΣPᵢ, Pᵢ=xᵢP가 성립한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k004","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"기체 밀도 ρ=PM/RT이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k005","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"Maxwell 분포에서 평균 운동에너지는 온도에 의존하고 rms 속력은 √(3RT/M)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k006","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"Graham 법칙에서 동일 조건의 분출속력은 몰질량 제곱근에 반비례한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k007","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"van der Waals 식 (P+a(n/V)²)(V−nb)=nRT에서 a는 인력, b는 분자의 배제부피 효과를 보정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k008","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"인력 압력 보정은 쌍 상호작용 빈도가 수밀도 제곱에 비례하는 평균장 모형과 연결된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k009","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"압축인자 Z=PV/nRT에서 이상기체는 1이며 인력이 우세한 조건에서는 1보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k010","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"작아질 수 있고 배제부피 효과가 강하면 커질 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k011","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"실제 기체는 일반적으로 낮은 압력과 높은 온도에서 이상성에 접근한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k012","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"R=8.314 J mol⁻¹ K⁻¹ 또는 0.08206 L atm mol⁻¹ K⁻¹.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k013","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"같은 온도에서 평균 병진 운동에너지는 몰질량과 무관하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k014","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"물 위에서 포집한 기체 압력은 수증기 분압을 빼야 한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k015","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"a(n/V)²은 인력에 의한 압력 감소 보정이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"gas--ideal-real-k016","sectionId":"gas/ideal-real","unitId":"gas","subject":"chemistry","text":"√(32/4)=√8이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}